1
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,760
Still can't find the tea?!

2
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:15,400
Yes.

3
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,760
Honda, you can just go ahead and say it.

4
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,980
So far, history hasn't changed,

5
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,400
so there are no problems.

6
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,460
I don't get it!

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,180
It'll be too late once history changes.

8
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,640
Anyway, we search every era thoroughly!

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,260
Me, take over the country?

10
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,140
Yes, exactly.

11
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,980
Come on,
keep your jokes to your eyebrows only.

12
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,800
I'm not joking, see? Right, Honda?

13
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,840
In the future, he'll go by the name
Toyotomi Hideyoshi and become kampaku.

14
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:51,220
No way, no way.
Anyway, how do you two know all that?

15
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,940
Well, how are we supposed
to explain that, senpai?

16
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,840
Whatever,
it's going to happen no matter what!

17
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,700
It's Lord Nobunaga!

18
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:00,600
Gahh!

19
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,680
We were trying to find out
about Lord Nobunaga's movements!

20
00:01:04,740 --> 00:01:05,860
What do we do?!

21
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,800
Why are you panicking?

22
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:12,100
Lord Nobunaga is incredibly short-tempered.

23
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,280
I might have my head cut off.

24
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,580
What should we do?

25
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,940
This is the end of my life.

26
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:23,720
Alright, leave it to me.

27
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,560
You two, hide!

28
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:25,980
Ugh.

29
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:33,240
Good morning, Lord Nobunaga.

30
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:35,540
So you're finally awake, I see.

31
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,340
You little...!

32
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:39,780
Uh-oh!

33
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,800
You were sitting on my rubber mat,
weren't you?

34
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:45,220
I'm throwing it out!

35
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:50,500
Whoa! It's not that it's warm
because someone sat on it!

36
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:52,760
Then why is it warm?!

37
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:56,715
It's because it's snowing and cold,
so I wanted to keep you a little warmer,

38
00:01:56,765 --> 00:01:59,060
so I tucked a straw sandal into my robe!

39
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,560
So that's what it was!

40
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,460
Monkey!
You went that far out of concern for me!

41
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:05,020
Yes!

42
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:08,385
What admirable loyalty.
Monkey, you're no longer a sandal-bearer.

43
00:02:08,435 --> 00:02:10,100
From today, you are a foot soldier!

44
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,540
Whoa! I'm deeply honored!

45
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:19,634
Lord Ryotsu, thank you so much.

46
00:02:19,684 --> 00:02:21,540
I don't know how to thank you enough.

47
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,702
Thanks aren't necessary.
When you become ruler of the land,

48
00:02:23,752 --> 00:02:26,340
just give me half of your fortune.

49
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:27,720
What a joke you make.

50
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:31,858
I'm not joking! Look,
I saved you from being beheaded, you know.

51
00:02:31,908 --> 00:02:34,060
Half your fortune is a bargain, isn't it?

52
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:37,400
Yes, understood. I'll give it, I'll give it.

53
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,320
Good, you promised. A promise is a promise.

54
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:41,100
Yes.

55
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:42,520
Well then, Honda, let's go.

56
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,900
Yes, where to?

57
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:44,620
Just come along!

58
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,440
Hurry up and get in.

59
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,060
Yes.

60
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:52,440
Alright, let's go, you four gentlemen!

61
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:52,920
Come on!

62
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,000
Don't forget our promise!

63
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,480
Where are you heading?

64
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:01,560
Well, that's obvious!

65
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,400
To the era of Kanpaku Hideyoshi!

66
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,480
Ōsone Castle, built by Hideyoshi!

67
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:06,380
Yes! That's the one!

68
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,120
Then let's go!

69
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:09,120
Over one mountain

70
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,960
Then, off we go!

71
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,780
