This is bad.

87
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:02,680
Then there's no way Hiyoshi-maru, the one
Nobunaga hates, can ever become ruler of the land!

88
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:05,100
We're going back to before
the Battle of Okehazama!

89
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,360
Look.

90
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,640
Help!

91
00:04:17,660 --> 00:04:19,020
What are you doing?

92
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:21,900
Ryotsu-dono, Honda-dono!

93
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:24,280
So you're going to fight Imagawa now, right?

94
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,493
Imagawa's army has forty thousand men,
and we have fewer than three thousand.

95
00:04:28,543 --> 00:04:30,840
We have no chance of winning,
so we're thinking of running away.

96
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:37,100
You idiot! History won't go as it should
because you keep interfering like that!

97
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:37,740
Oh yeah?!

98
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,640
Take off that armor!
I'm switching places with you again!

99
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:56,700
Hahahaha!

100
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:10,340
The Imagawa army is overconfident! We'll seize
this opening and make the victory ours! Let's go!

101
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:10,980
Oraaa!

102
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:19,780
