104
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,600
The Oda army has attacked!

105
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:26,500
What do we do? What do we do?

106
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,140
My lord, please calm yourself.

107
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:29,960
From what we can see,
the enemy has 3,000 soldiers.

108
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:33,080
We have 40,000 troops.
Their small force is nothing to fear.

109
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,280
That's right.

110
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,760
I panicked and made a mess of it.

