121
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,900
Retainer of Lord Nobunaga, Hiroshima Ruda.

122
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:32,120
Is that Imagawa Yoshimoto, then?

123
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,380
There are only two enemies!

124
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:35,820
I'll protect our lord with my life!

125
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:44,980
Next, we'll take on the big wave over there!

126
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,780
Yaaah!

127
00:06:54,620 --> 00:07:02,180
Yahoo! Yoshimaru has done it, indeed!

128
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,080
Yei! Yei!

129
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:12,980
Seeing Yoshimoto's pitiful state, the cowardly Imagawa
men scattered like a spider's web had been poked.

130
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:14,900
Well done, everyone!

131
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:22,580
But the greatest feat in this battle was taking Yoshimoto from the main camp,
and that was you, monkey.

132
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:27,280
Therefore, from today, monkey,
I appoint you kitchen official of my castle.

133
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:30,760
From now on, you shall change your
name from Hiroshima to Kinoshita Tōkirō.

134
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,960
I am most honored.

135
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:36,480
Ryotsu-dono, thank you so much.

136
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:39,040
