137
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,880
So don't forget, half your fortune.

138
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,100
Yes, I understand.

139
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,320
It's a promise.

140
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,580
Next up is Osaka Castle, right?

141
00:07:47,580 --> 00:07:51,420
After one mountain, it was Honda.

142
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:53,240
Pui-pui, on to Osaka Castle.

143
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,960
