144
00:07:58,960 --> 00:07:59,120
What?

145
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,780
Isn't this the same as last time, Sempai?

146
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:03,820
That's strange.

147
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,940
You lot again?! What are you doing?!

148
00:08:06,540 --> 00:08:08,880
Hey! Where's Hideyoshi of Osaka Castle?

149
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,880
I already told you,
I don't know any such man!

150
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:14,600
Sempai, what's going on here?

151
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,540
Damn it, we're going back again.

152
00:08:16,540 --> 00:08:17,280
