162
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,000
It's not impossible, you know.

163
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,460
That's how it goes in history.

164
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:46,300
Surely with his childhood
friend Hachisuka Koroku,

165
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:49,020
