two-thousand-strong Nobuuji army.

166
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,080
I see.

167
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,720
So that's one way to do it.

168
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,720
Well, there's no helping it.

169
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,940
Yeah, we'll help you out too,
so you'd better come through, seriously.

170
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,980
Yes, I'm always troubling you, I'm sorry.

171
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:00,620
